        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="d-notes" value="&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;*1 Why this Lambda sits in the VPC&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The ONTAP management LIF is private (TCP 443) while the S3 AP is Internet origin, so one Lambda cannot&lt;br&gt;serve both&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;*2 Update both credential stores together&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Changing the fsxadmin password in the FSx API but not in Secrets Manager (or the reverse) causes auth&lt;br&gt;failures that can lock the ONTAP account" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeColor=#E6EDF3;fillColor=#21262D;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontColor=#E6EDF3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="430" y="530" width="640" height="126" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
